msgstr "Pòlét:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 208
#: rc.cpp:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the list of available keyboard layouts in your system. You can add a "
"layout to the active list by selecting it and pressing \"Add\" button."
msgstr ""
"To je lësta przistãpnych ùkłôdów klawiaturë dlô Twòji systemë. Mòżesz dodac "
"ùkłôd do aktiwny lëstë wëbierając gò ë wcëskając knąpã \"Dodôj\"."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 233
#: rc.cpp:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the command which is executed when switching to the selected layout. "
"It may help you if you want to debug layout switching, or if you want to "
"switch layouts without the help of KDE."
msgstr ""
"To je pòlét jaczi bãdze zrëszony òbczas przełączaniô do wëbrónégò ùkłôdu. "
"Mòże pòmóc, czej chcesz debugòwac przełączanié ùkłôdów, abò czej chcesz "
"przełączac ùkłôdë bez pòmòcë KDE."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 243
#: rc.cpp:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Label:"
msgstr "Marka:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 263
#: rc.cpp:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Layout variant:"
msgstr "Wariant ùkłôdu:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 274
#: rc.cpp:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of selected keyboard layout. Layout variants "
"usually represent different key maps for the same language. For example, "
"Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in Windows), "
"typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter is placed "
"on a transliterated latin one).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tuwò mòżesz wëbrac wariant wëbrónégò ùkłôdu klawiaturë. Wariantë te zwëkòwò "
"reprezentëją różné mapòwanie klawiszów dlô tegò samégò jãzëka. Na przëmiôr, "
"ùkrajińsczi ùkłôd mòże miec wariantë: basic (pòdspòdlowi), winkeys (tak jak "
"w Windowsë), maszynistczi (jak w maszynach do pisaniô) ë fònetikòwi (kòżdô "
"ùkrajińskô lëtera je pòłożona na môlu gwësny lacëzniany lëtery).\n"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 317
#: rc.cpp:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switching Options"
msgstr "Òptacëje przełączaniô"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 341
#: rc.cpp:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select \"Application\" or \"Window\" switching policy, changing the "
"keyboard layout will only affect the current application or window."
msgstr ""
"Żelë wëbierzesz pòlitikã przełączaniô \"Programa\" abò \"Òkno\", zmiana "
"ùkłôdu klawiaturë bãdze sã tikac blós aplikacëji abò òkna."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 344
#: rc.cpp:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Switching Policy"
msgstr "Pòlitika przełączaniô"

