"Here you can set xkb extension options instead of, or in addition to, "
"specifying them in the X11 configuration file."
msgstr ""
"Tuwò mòżesz ùstawic òptacëje rozszérzenia xkb w môl abò dodównié do òpisania "
"jich w kònfigùracëjowim lopkù X11."

